<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have stepped up missile and drone attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking the Rabigh refinery and launching missiles toward Riyadh, while the Saudi-led coalition intercepted multiple missiles and a drone in the Red Sea and western Yemen. Saudi forces responded by striking Yemen's Hodeidah port city, killing ten civilians, and the coalition also reported intercepting a missile in the western region. Houthi fighters claimed seizure of large weapons stockpiles in Mokha and warned of further threats to Red Sea shipping. Dozens of children were killed in Yemen amid the intensified fighting, and 918 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOMVR0Um1jTVhZaVJCb0xZN2NkZjdiNHNwbTEwRzFhTHZHbVpsNTNiQnduMEpRQWlTQVgxNlotNkh4dVNUWkEwWUZIOW11NjNKWjlkaEk0eW5IUHc2UmdMS1AzbmpGaE5MdHhnd21QWGMwckVnMzdfZ2p4Q09nZm1HaEt0MVQ0X2FpYUJEVEtYNHVfVFhPQlpJc05FRTd4bnIwcXc0NEJ1Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQcUh3TDZoRkRsZGJTVnZfZ19oYTN3aUZrMEJYSlF0cXVSZXltWUNDWjdxOVJscUNKSDRCSFhxWmNlQ2J2dXhhZzAwc09sMFUtak1mTmpLcTcwMnY3c2pLdTJGeHN2Vnktc2lkSGJHc0E2R3ZEeXJXRzNmT2o2VlVLbGwzSjhaNGJuV1dKbEFzekRYTHl1V1pVMnlwLS1lby1fOXpTT0NjTzZGdV80SF9aSGtn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOSEh2RmU1Q2dvTnFtYW5PUDItZk40OVBZZnBqenUyLU1qVGlIa2JFMnJYbF83S3RoSFRobUY1Z2pHSUgyMEk1X3FwRGFqandqdU9GYmdkSEc4b0wwczF2MEUt